survived key. Survivor honest-report: first `P_dupnarrow_provider_id` run SURVIVED and exposed a real test gap (foreign `provider_id` missing from the envelope sweeper); key added, mutant re-run KILLED.\\n- F3 (denominator basis): corrected — 31 refuse sites + 59 bool-false + 11 `&Fault{}` frame exits = 101 (105 counting the 4 bool-`return <expr>` arms: CheckEnvironmentID/CheckSemver/isNull/rawUint53-forward). The \\\"27 of 100\\\" figure was the corrected basis pre-ladder-guard; 90 was the uncorrected one. Harness derives all three components at runtime; F3 residue exits attacked by N1/M15/M15n/M16/M17/M17n inside the previously excluded 11.\\n- EVIDENCE: battery `/tmp/mutbattery_leaf6/run.py` + `battery.log` + `results.json`: 70 killed / 71 applied (49 narrowing incl. D1 token-preserving delegation decoy + 8 owner + 6 retained duplicate narrowings; 17 arm-deletion incl. D2; 3 census-only; 1 audit-only; H1 NOT_APPLIED + H2 COMPILE_FAIL distinct rows; 1 predicted survivor R_digestnonstr, now property-pinned by `TestDigestBridgeRefusesEmptyDownstream`). Mutant table + outcome attached as round-2 resources.\\n- GATES: `go build` + `go vet` + `GOOS=windows` build/vet exit 0, gofmt clean, `go test ./...` exit 0 (23 ok), `go test ./... -race` exit 0 (23 ok, full repo — no race bound this round), `-cover` (env 92.4/sess 82.0/dir 87.7/ph 86.0/scalar 90.1/invcore 70.2).\\n- STATUS: handed off to review, work left uncommitted in the worktree for board CR.\\n\\n### 1215 — 33xcnc: remaining environment copies converged, residue re-derived, 54/55 battery\\n- SCOPE: TASK-260906-33xcnc (story final leaf). Production: `sessadapter/decode.go` + `dirnode/decode.go` (9 Check*/measure/extensions helpers each delegate to `environ.*`, 6 grammar vars deleted, rawUint53 trailing arm + ladder empty-guard hardened to the environ texture), grammar call sites (`sessadapter/manifest.go`, `tuple.go`, `probe.go`, `dirnode/probe.go`, `query.go`), `provhost/opdecode.go` (same trailing arm), `envir