"item\\\":5,\\\"text\\\":\\\"The per-session event chain is append-only in both obligations: appends succeed in order, and no production path can rewrite or delete an existing entry, each proven by a negative test\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":6,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Source sequence continuity is enforced: a gap or a repeat is refused with a named arm, driven at the boundary rather than mid-range\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":7,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Crash and idempotency evidence is produced through internal/secconftest crash points, covering a fault before the durable write and a fault after it\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":8,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every census derives its denominator from production and fails closed on an unregistered site, an orphan row and an unclassifiable site, each control-planted including an import alias and a var binding\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":9,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Existing owners are reused rather than reimplemented: no new decoder, bound check, path handling or AST walker duplicates environ, canonicaljson, secprim, secconftest or invcore\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":10,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Mutation battery reports killed over applied on a production-derived denominator with narrowing, arm-deletion, census-only and audit-only separate, and NOT_APPLIED and COMPILE_FAIL as distinct rows\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":11,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Candidate tree OID equals the record's by detached-index write-tree, the outcome enumerates exactly the CR changed paths, and no untracked ungitignored scratch file is present\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":12,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Code written per task description and AC\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":13,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant tests written for new or changed behavior and passing\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":14,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every command, message, state, or refusal named in the AC is driven through the production entry point by a named committed test, or is declared a stated bound. Report coverage as a ratio — `n of m AC rows driven` — and name the production call site for each. Prose in place of the ratio is not evidence.\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":15,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Gating, refusing, validating, authorizing, or attesting behavior covered by negative tests that fail when the gate admits what it must reject, with the production call site named\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":16,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every gate ships at least one NARROWING mutant — the gate stays present and is weakened to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and a named test must fail. A delete-only mutant proves only that the gate exists and is not accepted as evidence.\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":17,\\\"text\\\":\\\"A gate that inspects source text is additionally attacked by a mutant that PRESERVES the searched-for token and changes behavior, and the mutant harness executes the behavioral suite, not only the static checker.\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":18,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Lint clean\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":19,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant build/validation commands run after changes and build not broken\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":20,\\\"text\\\":\\\"New outcome artifact attached on the board with a task-scoped name when the work produces notes, logs, screenshots, or other deliverables\\\"}}\\n{\\\"ok\\\":true,\\\"result\\\":{\\\"checked\\\":true,\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-wbpf1v\\\",\\\"item\\\":21,\\\"text\\\":\\\"Important findings, decisions, anomalies, or regressions recorded in logbook when relevant\\\"}}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 4815,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1204,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
