{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000e013","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a07b9e-4019-7d82-8599-f430d1ae00b2"},"sequence":3684,"recorded_at":1780531400007363,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"868a1309-d750-4b15-8a10-0ca2d4130887","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"868a1309-d750-4b15-8a10-0ca2d4130887","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"868a1309-d750-4b15-8a10-0ca2d4130887"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Work is handed off to review (`to-review`, checklist 21/21, outcome attached).\n\nNew `internal/sessrepo` persists and validates Session Records and append-only per-session event chains: `CreateSession`/`AppendEvent` validate through `canonicaljson.VerifyObjectIdentity`, enforce gap/repeat/predecessor/divergent/stale arms with named errors, store blobs content-addressed no-replace with an atomic re-verified chain index, reload byte-identically across handles, and resolve local names with ASCII-fold ambiguity refusal. Evidence: 34-site invcore census all boundary-driven, mutation battery 12 applied / 12 killed (6 narrowing, 4 arm-deletion, 1 census-only, 1 audit-only; NOT_APPLIED/COMPILE_FAIL distinct), 4 secconftest crash tests, AC coverage 10 of 10 rows. Full repo suite, race over all 24 packages, both vets, gofmt, tracecheck, and catalog/claims gates all pass; fuzz smoke not run (no fuzzed package touched).\n\nOne cross-package change for reviewers to read first: the provhost attestation gate reddened as designed, so its bound is rewritten to allowlist `internal/sessrepo` (schema gate precedes every Verify call; proved still-red on foreign trees). Tree OID `93942f4c8f07a865c546516c1be50b82f9c4e4e6`, work left uncommitted for the CR.","reason":null}}
